text:
{
  "err01_open_text": "pour 2 eggs into the bowl instead of 1"
}

{
  "err02_open_text": "The person placed lettuce over the egg on the English muffin before replacing the top of the English muffin."
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "The person stirred the eggs before microwaving them instead of after."
}

{
  "err04_open_text": "The participant did not microwave the cheese on the sandwich; instead, they microwaved the bowl with the eggs, salsa, and cheese together."
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "The person used a fork instead of a spoon."
}

{
  "err07_open_text": "The participant added the chopped onion and garlic to the bowl after mixing in the flavor packet and stirring the noodles, rather than before adding the noodles and covering them with water."
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "The person placed the pinwheels on a plate one by one rather than all at once."
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "The person trimmed the ends of the tortilla roll using floss instead of a butter knife."
}

{
  "err06_open_text": "The person did not use floss to slice the tortilla, instead using a butter knife."
}

{
  "err08_open_text": "omitted nut butter and spread jelly directly on the tortilla"
}

{
  "err01_open_text": "heated the olive oil in a pan on the stove before pouring it over the platter"
}

{
  "err06_open_text": "The person peeled 5 garlic cloves instead of 4."
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "The person added mustard seeds instead of red chili powder."
}

{
  "err06_open_text": "The person poured tomato puree directly from the blender into the pan."
}

{
  "err02_open_text": "The participant poured 2 tbsp of oil instead of the prescribed 3 tbsp."
}

{
  "err07_open_text": "sliced the garlic instead of mincing it"
}

{
  "err04_open_text": "The participant poured the chopped tomato directly into the pan instead of blending it into a puree."
}

{
  "err07_open_text": "the person did not peel the cucumber before chopping it"
}

{
  "err02_open_text": "The person sliced the mushrooms before pulling out the mushroom stems."
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "Transfer the contents of the pan to a plate"
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "The person used a small red onion (shallot substitute) and peeled/chopped it directly by hand/knife without fully following the standard shallot slicing procedure or doing it at the correct recipe-specified timing."
}

{
  "err06_open_text": "splash maple syrup on pancakes instead of plate"
}

{
  "err07_open_text": "The person mashed and scrambled the pancakes instead of flipping them intact."
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "The person used a wooden spoon / spatula instead of a fork or fish slice spatula."
}

{
  "err06_open_text": "The participant poured the batter in four puddles instead of three."
}

{
  "err07_open_text": "Sriracha sauce was used instead of maple syrup"
}

{
  "err04_open_text": "The person poured a single large puddle instead of three little puddles."
}

{
  "err02_open_text": "Technique: instead of flipping the pancake like a normal pancake, the person scrambled it with a spatula."
}

{
  "err08_open_text": "Transfer the pancakes to a bowl instead of a plate"
}

{
  "err08_open_text": "The person transferred the tomatoes to the plate and served them with the omelette, but did not transfer the omelette to the plate."
}

{
  "err03_open_text": "The participant served the tomatoes before cooking the omelette, and placed the tomatoes on the plate before transferring the omelette onto the same plate."
}

{
  "err02_open_text": "The person used a wooden spatula instead of a scoop to remove the tomatoes from the pan."
}

{
  "err07_open_text": "the person takes two tomatoes instead of one"
}

{
  "err08_open_text": "The person whisked the contents of the bowl after adding soy sauce, honey, and cornstarch, but they did not add minced garlic, minced ginger, black pepper, or water to the bowl."
}

{
  "err04_open_text": "the person added 3 cloves of minced garlic instead of 2 cloves"
}

{
  "err07_open_text": "Frozen broccoli was added instead of fresh broccoli florets."
}

{
  "err06_open_text": "garlic was not minced, it was grated"
}

{
  "err02_open_text": "The participant placed the paper cupcake liner inside a mug without removing the paper liner from its cardboard packaging first, or misplaced the step in the sequence."
}

{
  "err04_open_text": "The person did not wait for the cake to cool down and immediately inverted the mug right after taking it out from the microwave."
}

{
  "err02_open_text": "the person applied the frosting in a spiral instead of dollops in a circle"
}

{
  "err02_open_text": "The person placed avocado slices on a lettuce leaf before laying out all prescribed lettuce leaves for the wraps (Order error)."
}

{
  "err06_open_text": "the person placed avocado slices and tuna mixture directly on the lettuce leaf instead of just avocado slices"
}

{
  "err08_open_text": "the person placed avocado slices on the lettuce leaves after topping them with the tuna mixture instead of before"
}

{
  "err07_open_text": "The person scooped the avocado out with a spoon instead of slicing it."
}

{
  "err01_open_text": "The participant did not place avocado slices on each leaf, but only placed them on one leaf."
}

{
  "err04_open_text": "added avocado into the mix instead of just placing them on the lettuce leaves"
}

{
  "err08_open_text": "The participant added chopped scallion to the bowl, but the recipe required adding it after chopping 1 scallion (along with avocado slices, tuna, mayo, and Sriracha), however, the participant mixed the tuna salad *before* adding the scallion and avocado slices (which were placed directly on the lettuce leaves instead of mixed in)."
}

{
  "err06_open_text": "stirred the contents with a wooden spoon"
}
